    "SANDSWEPT_SHRINE_SACRIFICE_DESCRIPTION": "Cum activatur, Shrine of Sacrifice {curseCost}% maximae valetudinis superstitis consumit pro {itemCount} exemplaribus fortuiti communis obiecti.",
    "SANDSWEPT_SHRINE_OF_SACRIFICE_DESCRIPTION": "Cum activatur, Shrine of Sacrifice {curseCost}% maximae valetudinis superstitis consumit pro {itemCount} exemplaribus fortuiti communis obiecti.",
    "SANDSWEPT_SHRINE_FUTURE_NAME": "Shrine of the Future",
